\newlabel{fig:v3_qualitative}{{3-6}{40}{Qualitative comparison of CWP detections between v1 and v3 at three example locations. In each panel, v1 polygons and v3 polygons are overlaid at 50\% transparency; areas covered by both algorithms appear as a blend of the two colours, while areas covered by only one algorithm appear in that algorithm's colour alone}{figure.caption.43}{}}
